CODEGEN.md §2.9, DECISIONS 294 (TX rulings): a misplaced @text with an emit text is E8021 alone, with no E8009 textEmpty; two emit text report textEmpty once at most (here none) beside E8002.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// Doc.
@text("v.sql")
fn v() -> String { return "x" }

emit text { out: "@generated/sql" }

emit text { out: "@generated/sql" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8021]  a/a.canon:4:1
  @text belongs on a public package-level export fn with no parameter that returns String

error[E8002]  a/a.canon:9:6
  package a has two emits for target text

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
